{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:49 2026-10-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:49 2026-10-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:49 2026-10-27 HKT</p><img alt=\"資料圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/744ce04d77e7adeec43b986b8ff94b6c/2026-10/page_238.jpg\"/><p>今日（27日）早上8時10分，警方接獲途人報案，指一輛私家車停泊在民泰街，懷疑該車輛掛有虛假的泊車證明書。警員到場發現涉事私家車的泊車證已經過期，懷疑其屆滿日期曾被人修改，經初步調查後以涉嫌「行使虛假文書」，拘捕32歲姓劉男司機。被捕人被帶返警署扣留調查，案件交由九龍城警區刑事調查隊第2隊跟進。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T08:22:35.652438+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T06:49:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T11:38:48.612789+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T08:19:14.722002+00:00","content_hash":"044502faed45b3decfd88463f17262c0f2d7e61fa7eb42da36d8b3ae74b77b82","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}